# Re-arm without replay: a closed hand-off re-arms the advance at once, so the
# owner passes the foreign entries below the close head unread.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestRearmWithoutReplay
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the owner re-arms once the marker closes, without replaying to the recorded head
PERTURBS: LiveAdvance

--- FIND
    /\ ~MarkerOpen(a)
    /\ rp[a] >= MarkerClosedAt(a) - 1
--- REPLACE
    /\ ~MarkerOpen(a)
\* MUTATION: no replay to the close head.
--- END